        {
          "path": "_m/d/j/n/0/monument-of-states-wp/monument-of-states-2016.jpg",
          "filename": "Monument of States 2016.jpg",
          "caption": "Monument of States in Kissimmee Florida, was erected in 1941 by local resident volunteers.  The Monument is 50 feet tall, weighting approximately 100,000 pounds. Stones were collected from all US States, Puerto Rico, Canada and 21 other Foreign Countries, some of which are signed by the Governor or Prime Ministers to be mounted on the Monument.   It is a goldmine for geology enthusiasts, Quartz, Marble, Granite, Limestone, Coral, Meteors, Diamonds, Silver, Cobalt and Gold are some of the rare and colorful stones found on the Monument.",
          "alt": "Monument of States in Kissimmee Florida, was erected in 1941 by local resident volunteers.  The Monument is 50 feet tall, weighting approximately 100,000 pounds. Stones were collected from all US States, Puerto Rico, Canada and 21 other Foreign Countries, some of which are signed by the Governor or Prime Ministers to be mounted on the Monument.   It is a goldmine for geology enthusiasts, Quartz, Marble, Granite, Limestone, Coral, Meteors, Diamonds, Silver, Cobalt and Gold are some of the rare and colorful stones found on the Monument.",
          "width": 4912,
          "height": 2760,
